<title>USA: Aquila extends rights exercise period.</title>
<headline>Aquila extends rights exercise period.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aquila Biopharmaceuticals Inc said on Friday it had extended the exercise period under its rights offering for another 15 days, to December 3.</p>
<p>The other terms of the offering remained the same, the company said. Aquila said it had also reserved the right to reduce the unit subscription price.</p>
</text>
